     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation HumphreyVFRightEyeExample</b></p><a name=\"HumphreyVFRightEyeExample\"> </a><a name=\"hcHumphreyVFRightEyeExample\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-humphrey-visual-field.html\">Ophthalmic Humphrey Visual Field</a></p></div><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category exam}\">Exam</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Automated static perimetry, right eye</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-PatientExample.html\">Patient Example  Female, DoB: 1990-01-01 ( PA1234567)</a></p><p><b>note</b>: </p><blockquote><div><p>Example based on typical Humphrey Field Analyzer 24-2 SITA Standard report. Right eye borderline unreliable fixation losses within normal limits.</p>\n</div></blockquote><p><b>bodySite</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\"></span></p><p><b>method</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">SITA Standard</span></p><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Test pattern</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 24-2</p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Mean Deviation (MD)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: -3.42 dB<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codedB = 'dB')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Pattern Standard Deviation (PSD)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 4.15 dB<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codedB = 'dB')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Visual Field Index (VFI)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 91 %<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code% = '%')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Fixation strategy</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Gaze tracking</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Stimulus size</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Goldmann III</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Stimulus color</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">White</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Background luminance</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 31.5 asb</p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Stimulus duration</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 200 ms<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codems = 'ms')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Foveal sensitivity</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 34 dB<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codedB = 'dB')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Test duration</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 6 min<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemin = 'min')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Number of test points</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 54 1<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code1 = '1')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Correction lens used</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Yes, near correction trial lens</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Correction lens